      "content": "wait 20mg extra?? i dont know if i should do that without asking my doctor first. but if i do the caffeine stuff, like if i just have a couple of coffees or some caffeine pills with my regular dose, is that actually dangerous? i feel like i can handle a bit of extra caffeine, i drink it all the time anyway.",
